:: MP Alert Mansion Bluff [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpAlertArea to "velvet">>
你理了理衣领，抢在保镖开口前用宴会宾客的口吻报出厅堂与席位，反问他为何把侍者通道堵死。走廊尽头的脚步声迟疑着停住了。
<br><br>
<<if (($seductionskill or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260) and random(1, 100) lte 75>>
	对方被你的气势唬住，侧身让开半步。你端着空托盘从容退回帘幕后的阴影里。
	<<set $mpAlert to Math.clamp(($mpAlert or 0) - 20, 0, 100)>>
	<span class="green">保镖暂时收起了疑心。</span><<mpalertloss "宴会宾客的口吻">>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[退回帘幕后 (0:06)|($mpAlertReturn or $mpReturnPassage or "Danube Street")]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
	保镖眯起眼打量你的鞋尖，手已经按上警棍。你只得慢慢后退。
	<<set $mpAlert to Math.clamp(($mpAlert or 0) + 15, 0, 100)>>
	<span class="red">你的说法没能镇住对方。</span><<mpalertgain "口音露出破绽">>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[退回暗处 (0:04)|($mpAlertReturn or $mpReturnPassage or "Danube Street")]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Alert Mansion Flee [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你把手里的银器往托盘上一撂，趁保镖侧身避让的刹那撞开侍者门，沿着仆役窄梯一路冲下。宴会乐声很快盖过了身后的呵斥。
<<mpalertclear>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从仆役侧门离开 (0:06)|($mpReturnPassage or "Danube Street")]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
